HC-SR04 + LED + Buzzer → ESP32

HC-SR04

VCC → ESP32 5V / VIN
GND → ESP32 GND
TRIG → ESP32 GPIO 5
ECHO → ESP32 GPIO 18

⚠️ Important: HC-SR04 ECHO outputs 5V, while ESP32 GPIOs are 3.3V. Use a voltage divider/level shifter between ECHO and GPIO 18.

LED

LED anode (+) → ESP32 GPIO 2
LED cathode (−) → 220Ω resistor → GND

Buzzer

Buzzer + → ESP32 GPIO 25
Buzzer − → GND
